Knowledge of Project Management principles and practices;
Knowledge of the National Building Regulations and relevant SANS standards;
Knowledge of building and construction practices;
Knowledge of construction contract law and standard forms of contract, including JBCC, FIDIC, NEC and GCC;
Knowledge of PROCSA agreements;
Knowledge of Risk Management principles and practices;
Proficiency in Microsoft Office;
Proficiency in project management and construction software, including MS Project, CCS and/or Primavera;
Budget compilation, control and financial/cost management skills;
Administrative and organisational skills;
Ability to sequence and schedule project activities;
Programme and project management skills;
Ability to interpret and monitor construction programmes;
Construction quality management skills;
SHE and construction safety management knowledge;
Strong communication and interpersonal skills;
Negotiation and argumentation skills;
Stakeholder management skills, including engagement with internal and external stakeholders;
Conflict management and leadership skills;
Ability to organise, prioritise and manage multiple tasks effectively;
Ability to work effectively in a team;
Results-driven approach;
People-focused, caring and nurturing;
High level of accuracy and attention to detail;
Demonstrates integrity, respect, trustworthiness and honesty.
